<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<trafficSystem xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" licensePlates="$data/maps/mapUS/licensePlates/aiLicensePlatesUS.i3d" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="../../../../shared/xml/schema/trafficSystem.xsd" maxNumVehicles="10">
    <!--
      Fleet for gravel section-line township roads northeast of Manvel, ND
      (Grand Forks County, Red River Valley). 'probability' and
      'probabilityParked' are relative weights, not percentages; the base
      game's own maps use 1 and 2 the same way.

      DRIVING MIX (probability), total weight 52:
        ~38%  US-exclusive cars   vehicle01/03/11/19, weighted 5 each. These
                                  are the models GIANTS ships on mapUS only,
                                  so they carry the American look.
        ~31%  shared cars         vehicle07/09/10/12/14/20/21/21RS, weighted
                                  2 each. GIANTS uses these on both mapUS and
                                  mapEU, so they read as generic rather than
                                  distinctly American; kept at a lower weight
                                  for variety without diluting the US feel.
         ~6%  postal van          one rural carrier, daily route.
        ~12%  tipperTruck         grain hauling; the most common heavy
                                  vehicle in farm country year-round.
         ~6%  dumpTruck           county gravel-road maintenance.
         ~4%  schoolBus           real weekday routes, twice a day.
         ~2%  postalServiceTruck  second mail vehicle, deliberately rare.
         ~2%  cementTruck         needs active construction to make sense.

      PARKED MIX (probabilityParked) for the Farmers Market lot:
        NOTE: probabilityParked is NOT a relative weight the way probability
        is. Every base game map uses only 0 or 1 for it, and never 2 or a
        fraction, while probability does use 2, so treat it as eligibility
        (0 = never parks, 1 = parks). Setting it to 1.5 here stopped ALL
        parked cars from spawning, with nothing logged; the value is out of
        range and evidently poisons the parked selection rather than being
        clamped. Keep it 0 or 1.

        So: all 12 passenger cars plus tipperTruck are eligible, 13 in all,
        giving a grain truck roughly a 1-in-13 chance per slot, about 0.5
        trucks across the lot's 7 slots. The parkedCar nodes are spaced 3.5m
        apart with 8m of depth precisely so that truck fits whatever slot it
        randomly lands in without clipping its neighbours. The other heavies
        stay at 0: a cement truck or school bus in a farmers market lot reads
        wrong, and both are longer than the lot.
    -->
    <vehicles>
        <vehicle filename="$data/trafficVehicles/vehicle01/vehicle01.xml" probability="5" probabilityParked="1" typeFlag="1" />
        <vehicle filename="$data/trafficVehicles/vehicle03/vehicle03.xml" probability="5" probabilityParked="1" typeFlag="1" />
        <vehicle filename="$data/trafficVehicles/vehicle11/vehicle11.xml" probability="5" probabilityParked="1" typeFlag="1" />
        <vehicle filename="$data/trafficVehicles/vehicle19/vehicle19.xml" probability="5" probabilityParked="1" typeFlag="1" />
        <vehicle filename="$data/trafficVehicles/vehicle07/vehicle07.xml" probability="2" probabilityParked="1" typeFlag="1" />
        <vehicle filename="$data/trafficVehicles/vehicle09/vehicle09.xml" probability="2" probabilityParked="1" typeFlag="1" />
        <vehicle filename="$data/trafficVehicles/vehicle10/vehicle10.xml" probability="2" probabilityParked="1" typeFlag="1" />
        <vehicle filename="$data/trafficVehicles/vehicle12/vehicle12.xml" probability="2" probabilityParked="1" typeFlag="1" />
        <vehicle filename="$data/trafficVehicles/vehicle14/vehicle14.xml" probability="2" probabilityParked="1" typeFlag="1" />
        <vehicle filename="$data/trafficVehicles/vehicle20/vehicle20.xml" probability="2" probabilityParked="1" typeFlag="1" />
        <vehicle filename="$data/trafficVehicles/vehicle21/vehicle21.xml" probability="2" probabilityParked="1" typeFlag="1" />
        <vehicle filename="$data/trafficVehicles/vehicle21/vehicle21RS.xml" probability="2" probabilityParked="1" typeFlag="1" />
        <vehicle filename="$data/trafficVehicles/vehicle15/vehicle15_post02.xml" probability="3" probabilityParked="0" typeFlag="1" />
        <vehicle filename="$data/trafficVehicles/tipperTruck/tipperTruck.xml" probability="6" probabilityParked="1" typeFlag="2" />
        <vehicle filename="$data/trafficVehicles/dumpTruck/dumpTruck.xml" probability="3" probabilityParked="0" typeFlag="2" />
        <vehicle filename="$data/trafficVehicles/schoolBus/schoolBus.xml" probability="2" probabilityParked="0" typeFlag="2" />
        <vehicle filename="$data/trafficVehicles/postalServiceTruck/postalServiceTruck.xml" probability="1" probabilityParked="0" typeFlag="2" />
        <vehicle filename="$data/trafficVehicles/cementTruck/cementTruck.xml" probability="1" probabilityParked="0" typeFlag="2" />
    </vehicles>
</trafficSystem>
